  "bodyHash": "2f1941103d0b7ec0",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5;font-size:28px\">音乐通知</span></p>\n<p>当游戏中播放音乐时，会弹出提示框，显示曲目的名称、作者及专辑名称。</p>\n<h3><strong>依赖</strong>： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>📷 游戏内截图</h1>\n<div>\n<table style=\"width:85.0344%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast_album.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">显示专辑名称\": true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/toasts.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"344\" height=\"252\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">不同的提示框配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/1.21.8/img/modded1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">支持模组内容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-mc-music-discs\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多音乐唱片</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/.github/assets/jukebox_home_tab.webp\" alt=\"留声机菜单\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><img src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/img/jukebox.png)\" alt=\"\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">使用留声机菜单随时随地点播任意音乐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>🎀 提示框样式</h1>\n<div>\n<table style=\"width:85.0344%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast.webp\" alt=\"留声机菜单\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><img src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/img/jukebox.png)\" alt=\"\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">普通提示框</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/action_bar.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">操作栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/compact.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">紧凑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h1>⚙ 设置</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/config.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>视频预览</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fHK2swFtPanA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/HK2swFtPanA</a></p>\n<h1>自定义</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>若要添加对自定义音乐的支持或自定义现有曲目，您需要在自定义资源包下的 `musicnotification` 命名空间中添加一个名为 `musics.json` 的文件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>JSON Schema 文档可在此查看：<a href=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/blob/next-stonecutter/DOCS.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DOCS.md</a><br>如有任何问题，欢迎提交 Issue。</p>\n<h1>贡献者</h1>\n<p>唱片图标由 <a href=\"https://github.com/carotteatomique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">carotteatomique</a> 制作<br>模组图标由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdribbble.com%252fakairoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">akairoo</a> 制作<br>简体中文翻译由 <a href=\"https://github.com/Chiloven945\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chiloven945</a> 完成</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
